  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Veterans Evaluation Services has obligated $1.7B in federal contracts in FY2026 to date. Veterans Evaluation Services won 25 awards so far this fiscal year, with an average award size of $66.5M. Obligations are down 18.2% year over year. Annual obligations rose from $617M in FY21 to $1.1B in FY24, peaked at $2B in FY25, and then moved to $1.7B in FY26. The reported totals are contract obligations, except where individual award values and expiring-contract tables show total contract values. The FY2026 total is a fiscal year to date figure, so year totals for FY2026 are partial.",
